### [RAPORTY] (placeholder) – pobranie pliku po URL
# Przyk³ad: GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Csv
GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Csv
Accept: application/octet-stream

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Csv

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport XLSX
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Xlsx

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Pdf

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport DOCX
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Docx

### [RAPORTY] podsumowanie PDF
GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Pdf

### [RAPORTY] faktury CSV
GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=faktury&format=Csv&take=50

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport PDF + archiwum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=podsumowanie&format=Pdf&archive=true

### [RAPORTY][DEMO] eksport XLSX bez archiwum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/eksport?reportKey=faktury&format=Xlsx&archive=false

### [RAPORTY] Podgl¹d danych – podsumowanie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/podglad-danych?reportKey=podsumowanie&take=50

### [RAPORTY] Podgl¹d danych – faktury
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/raporty/podglad-danych?reportKey=faktury&take=50

### [RAPORTY] Podgl¹d dokumentu (create)
GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/podglad-dokumentu?reportKey=podsumowanie&take=50

# Nastêpnie weŸ PreviewId z odpowiedzi i wklej:
### [RAPORTY] Podgl¹d dokumentu (stream)
GET {{CastlePlus2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/raporty/podglad-dokumentu/{{previewId}}

### [AUTH] login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginOrEmail": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "deviceInfo": "api.http"
}

### [AUTH] register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "nowy.user",
  "email": "nowy.user@local",
  "password": "haslo123",
  "deviceInfo": "api.http"
}

### [AUTH] me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### [AUTH] refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}",
  "deviceInfo": "api.http"
}

### [AUTH][ADMIN] users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### [AUTH][ADMIN] roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### [AUTH][ADMIN] set roles
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/admin/users/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleCodes": [
    "Admin"
  ]
}

### [KONFIGURACJA] Create ZasobUI (CMS)
